ּעָה:"}], "paragraph": 1}]}, "stem": "musaf_repetition_gevurot_open", "title": {"en": "Divine might — Musaf repetition", "he": "אתה גבור — חזרת מוסף"}, "urn": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/repetition_gevurot_open", "wording_selection": [{"features": {"urn:x-opensiddur:condition:prayer:amidah/gevurot/attah_gibbor/for_ever": false, "urn:x-opensiddur:condition:prayer:amidah/gevurot/attah_gibbor/forever": true, "urn:x-opensiddur:condition:prayer:amidah/gevurot/mekhalkel_chayyim/falling_and_healing": false, "urn:x-opensiddur:condition:prayer:amidah/gevurot/mekhalkel_chayyim/falling_healing": true}, "type": "opensiddur:variant"}]}, "variants": []}
